1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The customer begins a guided fitting before arriving at the store.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The app captures occasion, colors, style signals, catalog scope, outfit context, store, and time.

3
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:55,000
After confirmation, the customer can manage the appointment, message the stylist, and return later for recap and feedback.

4
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:20,000
The associate starts from an operational dashboard with searchable open appointments.

5
00:02:20,000 --> 00:03:10,000
AI-assisted suggestions combine customer context, fit signals, product details, and associate-facing rationale.

6
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:45,000
The associate marks products as pulled, adds prep notes, and messages the customer from the same workspace.

7
00:03:45,000 --> 00:04:25,000
At check-in, session capture unlocks so internal notes and customer-facing recap stay separate.

8
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:50,000
The customer reads the recap in the app and submits feedback after the fitting.

9
00:04:50,000 --> 00:05:00,000
The demo connects customer intent, associate prep, in-store capture, recap, and feedback.
